# Review owners. The main branch ruleset requires code-owner review, so a change to a path below needs approval from its
# team. Teams are in the Avana-Labs GitHub organisation and need write access for review requests to work.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching rule, so narrower paths come after broader ones. Several owners on one line are
# alternatives: an approval from any one of them is enough. A change that needs two separate sign-offs is enforced by
# the ruleset or a required check, not by listing two owners.

*                                                @Avana-Labs/core

# Contract code, deployment scripts and the tests that check them.
/contracts/                                      @Avana-Labs/contracts
# Triage files can silence an analyzer finding, so a security reviewer approves every change.
/contracts/security/                             @Avana-Labs/security
# The pinned fork blocks set the chain state every fork test sees.
/contracts/test/utils/fixtures/ForkConstants.sol @Avana-Labs/contracts @Avana-Labs/security

# Specification and its verification models.
/spec/                                           @Avana-Labs/contracts
# Review records, findings and verification evidence.
/audit/                                          @Avana-Labs/security

# Release manifests and generated address libraries: a verified manifest is approved by the deployment signers.
/deployments/verified/                           @Avana-Labs/deployers
/packages/protocol/sol/                          @Avana-Labs/deployers

# Governance operations and payloads.
/governance/                                     @Avana-Labs/governance

# Off-chain services: the indexer, Convex backend and shared wire types fall under core.
/services/                                       @Avana-Labs/core
# The keeper sends liquidation and poke transactions, so a security reviewer approves every change.
/services/keeper/                                @Avana-Labs/security

# CI, dependency policy, secret scanning and these rules.
/.github/                                        @Avana-Labs/security
/.gitleaks.toml                                  @Avana-Labs/security
/lefthook.yml                                    @Avana-Labs/security
/SECURITY.md                                     @Avana-Labs/security

# Licences and notices.
/LICENSE                                         @Avana-Labs/security
/LICENSING.md                                    @Avana-Labs/security
/LICENSES/                                       @Avana-Labs/security
/NOTICE                                          @Avana-Labs/security
/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md                         @Avana-Labs/security
